# 1. Handle Line EndingS
* text=auto eol=lf

# 2. Explicitly mark web code as text
*.html text
*.css text
*.js text
*.json text
*.md text

# 3. Mark Graphics as Binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text

# 4. Mark Video/Audio as Binary (CRITICAL for your project)
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.webm binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary

# 5. Fonts (If you add local pixel fonts later)
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary